.TH QUIPU-IMPACT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-impact \- Walk what depends on an entity, optionally after a speculative removal
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu impact\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-hops\fR] [\fB\-\-predicate\fR] [\fB\-\-remove\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIentity\-IRI\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Walk what depends on an entity, optionally after a speculative removal
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-hops\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-predicate\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-remove\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIentity\-IRI\fR>

